{"id":"vod_bf_46410","vodId":"46410","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"装神少女小缠","name_cn":"装神少女小缠","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-47/b9efcbdc9e33e86d42565648139fd486.jpg"},"summary":"皇缠（诹访彩花 配音）是一名平凡的初中二年级女生，从小就离开了父母，和祖父母过着相依为命的生活，皇缠因此格外渴望亲情，也渴望着看似一成不变但实际上充满了小确幸的平静生活。草薙由麻（大空直美 配音）是皇缠的好友，同时也是身上流淌着巫女血脉的巫女候补，肩上背负着沉重的责任。　　某一日，两人在前往神社的路上遭遇了一连串的意外，一个行踪诡异的男人成为了危害小镇宁静的不安定因素，为了压制疯狂的男人，由麻进行了“神悬仪式”，然而，让所有人都没有想到的是，被神明附身而拥有了能够降妖除魔的能力的人，却是皇缠。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:17:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/OVA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhuangshenshaonvxiaochan/第12